Package: Rmxdat
Title: Mexican Data for Monitoring Sustainable Development
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Federico", "Castro Monzon",
           email = "fcastro.rpackages@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides documented datasets about Mexico to support
    analysis of sustainable development, social conditions, and
    state-level indicators. Includes state-level population and
    social-program indicators and national poverty and deprivation
    estimates. The initial focus is on datasets relevant to monitoring
    the United Nations Sustainable Development Cooperation Framework
    for Mexico, 2026-2031. Documentation records data sources, coverage,
    transformations, and reuse conditions. This is an independent
    project with no affiliation with the United Nations or the
    Mexican government.
